---
// `/` is the dashboard now: signed out it is the poster, signed in it is the
// stats and the way into the library. Two dashboards was the confusion this
// change exists to remove, so this route keeps its PROTECTED_ROUTES entry and
// forwards. If an account screen is ever wanted it should be /account, with a
// reason to exist rather than this stub kept alive out of momentum.
//
// Set on Astro.response rather than `return Astro.redirect("/")`: a top-level
// return in frontmatter crashes @typescript-eslint/no-misused-promises with
// exit 2. See context/foundation/lessons.md.
Astro.response.status = 302;
Astro.response.headers.set("Location", "/");
---
